Project: ceres-solver
URL: http://ceres-solver.org/
License: BSD License
Upstream version: 1.13.0

Local modifications:

  * Use minilog to avoid using glog
  * Remove automatic headers search to limit to openMVG libraries scope
  * The EIGEN_SPARSE sparse linear algebra library (internal/ceres/eigensparse.cc)
    uses Eigen::SupernodalLDLT from DirectLUSolvers (third_party/DirectLUSolvers)
    instead of Eigen::SimplicialLDLT. SparseCholesky::Create takes the linear
    solver's num_threads, which the factorization uses through OpenMP when
    ceres is built with OpenMP. openMVG_ceres is compiled as C++17.
  * schur_eliminator_impl.h: std::random_shuffle (removed in C++17) replaced
    by std::shuffle.
